            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Caracalla</strong><br>\nCaracalla was born Lucius Septimius Bassianus on April 4, 188 AD, in Lugdunum, Gaul (now Lyon, France). He was the elder son of Septimius Severus, the future Roman Emperor, and Julia Domna, a Syrian noblewoman. Caracalla's upbringing was marked by a lavish court life and intense military training, preparing him for future roles in leadership and combat. As a young man, he adopted the name Caracalla after the Gallic cloak he often wore, which became synonymous with his identity.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Power</strong><br>\nAfter his father became emperor in 193 AD, Caracalla was appointed as his successor and held the position of Caesar. He was later promoted to co-Augustus, ruling jointly with his father and younger brother, Geta. Caracalla's path to power was not without conflict, as he and Geta were rivals from a young age. This rivalry intensified after their father's death in 211 AD, which led to a joint rule that was marked by discord and strife.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Murder of Geta</strong><br>\nThe co-rule between Caracalla and Geta ended in bloodshed when Caracalla had his brother murdered in their mother's arms in December 211 AD. This act cemented Caracalla's reputation as a ruthless leader willing to do whatever it took to secure his power. He then ordered a damnatio memoriae, a condemnation of memory, against Geta, attempting to erase all traces of his brother's existence.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
